
@{
    Layout = null;
}

<div class="popup">
    <div class="modal-body note-content">
        <ul class="level1">
            <li><span class="bold">Time:</span> kick-off time (in Deadball events) or Live score (in Live events).</li>
            <li><span class="bold">Event:</span> names of <span class="bold positive">Home</span>/<span class="bold">Away</span> teams.</li>
            <li><span class="bold">Bet Type:</span> all available bet types and selected choices for that event.</li>
            <li>
                <span class="bold">Bet Count:</span> number of bet tickets.
                <ul class="level2">
                    <li><span class="bold">Handicap:</span> number of tickets bet on Home/Away team.</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">Over Under:</span> number of tickets bet on Over/Under choice.</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">1X2:</span> number of tickets bet on Home team/Draw/Away team.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="bold">Turnover</span>
                <ul class="level2">
                    <li><span class="bold">Handicap:</span> amount of stakes bet on Home/Away team.</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">Over Under:</span> amount of stakes bet on Over/Under choice.</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">1X2:</span> amount of stakes bet on Home team/Draw/Away team.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="bold">Forecast Win/Loss:</span> predicts win loss amount on running tickets of the event (the <span class="bold">Black Negative Number</span> indicates the amount you may win and members may lose, whereas, the <span class="bold positive">Red Positive Number</span> indicates the amount you may lose and members may win).
                <ul class="level2">
                    <li>
                        <span class="bold">Hadicap</span>
                        <ul class="level3">
                            <li><span class="bold">Deadball:</span> predicts win loss amount of three total goals nearest zero, with different forecast figures.</li>
                            <li><span class="bold">Live:</span> predicts win loss amount of three cases (current score, one more goal scored by Home team, and one more goal scored by Away team).</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="bold">Over Under</span>
                        <ul class="level3">
                            <li><span class="bold">Deadball:</span> predicts win loss amount of three total goals nearest zero, with different forecast figures.</li>
                            <li><span class="bold">Live:</span> predicts win loss amount of 3 cases (current score, current score + 1, and current score + 2)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li><span class="bold">1X2:</span>predicts win loss amount of three cases: Home wins, Draw and Away wins.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="bold">Forecast Total:</span> summarizes total Forecast Win Loss amount on running tickets of the event.
                <ul class="level2">
                    <li><span class="bold">Deadball:</span> the total Forecast Win Loss amount on the event before kick-off.</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">Live:</span> the total Forecast Win Loss amount on the event with the current live score.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="note">Note: All figures of Turnover and Forecast above are after deducting Position Taking.</div>
    </div>
</div>